WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:06.140
Hi! I'm Momo. Let's practice Could you, please?.

2
00:00:06.540 --> 00:00:08.164
request

3
00:00:08.564 --> 00:00:09.979
outlet

4
00:00:10.379 --> 00:00:11.983
hold the door

5
00:00:12.383 --> 00:00:14.518
Could you help me with this?

6
00:00:14.918 --> 00:00:17.797
Could you hold the door, please?

7
00:00:18.197 --> 00:00:20.332
Could I use this outlet?

8
00:00:20.732 --> 00:00:23.146
Would you mind moving your bag?

9
00:00:23.546 --> 00:00:27.101
Thank you. I really appreciate it.

10
00:00:27.501 --> 00:00:31.265
Excuse me. Could I use this outlet?

11
00:00:31.665 --> 00:00:35.135
Of course. Let me move my bag.

12
00:00:35.535 --> 00:00:39.089
Thank you. I really appreciate it.

13
00:00:39.489 --> 00:00:41.144
You're welcome.

14
00:00:41.544 --> 00:00:45.688
Remember this expression. Could I open the window?

15
00:00:46.088 --> 00:00:52.803
Great job! Pause, repeat, and make it your own. See you in the next lesson!
